DESCRIPTION:Shapel Lacey is a Los Angeles based comedian born and raised in
  Mesa\, Arizona. A diehard punk rocker and former award-winning competitive
  cheerleader\, Shapel found ways to express himself and own his individuali
 ty at an early age. Shapel was cheerleading competitively for University of
  Louisville when someone dared him to take the stage as a comedian and he n
 ever looked back\, dropping out shortly thereafter to pursue a career in st
 and up full-time. His unique life experiences such as having 3 dads\, his p
 unk rock mentality\, and his stage presence make for a truly original voice
  in the comedy community. Diligence and the desire to grow led Shapel from 
 the Phoenix open mic circuit onto main stages in Los Angeles\, where he reg
 ularly performs at The Comedy Store\, Laugh Factory and Hollywood Improv. S
 hapel has a 30 minute special out through Don’t Tell Comedy\, called “T
 hree Dads\, Two Moms.” and can be seen headlining comedy clubs across the
  country.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & 
 beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nThere 
 is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled w
 ith any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks 
 purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\
